                                                  rdfs:comment "Curated with GO AI HUB. (CHRNA4)2:(CHRNB2)3 nAChR in the cholinergic synapse acetylcholine cycle: VAChT loading and ACHE hydrolysis regulating the channel."^^xsd:string ,
